====================================================
  Harness Curator — schedule installer
====================================================

Target OS:  Linux
Curator:    <SCRIPTS>/curate
Logfile:    <HOME>/.local/state/crewrig/harness-curator.log

Installed cron entry:
  0 9 * * 1 /bin/bash -lc 'bash <SCRIPTS>/curate --apply --dedup --max-issues 5' >> <HOME>/.local/state/crewrig/harness-curator.log 2>&1

Reactive trigger (run manually when a severity:high friction is filed):
    bash <SCRIPTS>/curate --apply --dedup --max-issues 5
